window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Some secrets give life. Others consume it. What happens when you learn the difference too late?</p> <p>Through cursed battlefields and crumbling ruins, relics of sorcery and lost machines resurface, each with the power to destroy kingdoms.</p> <p>Across the centuries, an ageless dark sorcerer has been weaving rituals of death and control that now threaten to consume both sides of the Rift.</p> <p>To stop him, Kase Hamerson must outwit rival guilds, risk tombs guarded by lethal curses, and battle demons born of another world.</p> <p>Every discovery draws him deeper into a mystery that harbors a terrible secret. Every victory comes with a cost.</p> <p>For fans of Sanderson, Rothfuss, Hobb, and Weeks, you've found your next fantasy addiction here.</p> <p>Get your copy of <i>Spiritbridge</i> by best selling author Chris Fritschi today and begin your journey.</p>"; 
